     "content": "The user wants me to plan evidence queries for round 1 for crime CHN-GU-2025-000945. I need to return a JSON with steps, first step must be q_candidates with at least days=45 and ring=6. Then other queries as needed, up to 8 steps.\n\nI have the case data: crime_id, category robbery, sub_type cab_robbery, station_id, occurred_from 2025-08-18 00:11:00+05:30, ward 170, h3_r9 89618c4f123ffff, plates [\"22\", \"7312\", \"??\", \"TN\", \"TN22??7312\"], mo with various details.\n\nI need to decide parameters for each query.\n\n1. q_candidates: crime_id = \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\", days=45, ring=6 (minimum). Could also use larger but instruction says at least 45 and 6. I'll use 45 and 6.\n\n2. q_vehicle_trail: plate_pattern = \"TN22??7312\" (the most complete pattern). t0 and t1 around the crime time. The crime occurred 2025-08-18 00:11. I'll set t0 a few days before, t1 a few days after. Maybe t0 = \"2025-08-15T00:00:00+05:30\", t1 = \"2025-08-22T00:00:00+05:30\". cells optional, but can include h3_r9 \"89618c4f123ffff\". I'll include cells array with that h3.\n\n3. q_offender_return: mo_tags derived from mo. The mo has approach, offender_count, target, target_item, escape, violence, time_band, place_type. I'll create tags: \"posed_as_ride_hailing_cab\", \"offender_count_3\", \"man_aged_35\", \"cash_and_mobile_phone\", \"drove_away_in_car\", \"knife_shown_to_threaten\", \"night\", \"hotel_nearby_or_parking\". Ward = 170. Since = 90 days before crime? The param since is a date string. I'll set since = \"2025-05-20T00:00:00+05:30\" (90 days before 2025-08-18). Actually 90 days before is 2025-05-20. I'll use that.\n\n4. q_calls_near: crime_id = \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\".\n\n5. q_tip_corroboration: crime_id = \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\".\n\n6. q_news: crime_id = \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\".\n\n7. q_context: crime_id = \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\".\n\nThat's 7 steps. Could also include q_dq_flags but we don't have ids yet. Might skip.\n\nNow construct JSON. Ensure each step has name, params, why.\n\nI'll write the JSON.</think>{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_candidates\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\",\n        \"days\": 45,\n        \"ring\": 6\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Find similar crimes within 45 days and 6km radius to identify potential series\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_vehicle_trail\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"plate_pattern\": \"TN22??7312\",\n        \"t0\": \"2025-08-15T00:00:00+05:30\",\n        \"t1\": \"2025-08-22T00:00:00+05:30\",\n        \"cells\": [\"89618c4f123ffff\"]\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Track vehicle movements near crime location around incident time\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_offender_return\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"mo_tags\": [\n          \"posed_as_ride_hailing_cab\",\n          \"offender_count_3\",\n          \"man_aged_35\",\n          \"cash_and_mobile_phone\",\n          \"drove_away_in_car\",\n          \"knife_shown_to_threaten\",\n          \"night\",\n          \"hotel_nearby_or_parking\"\n        ],\n        \"ward\": 170,\n        \"since\": \"2025-05-20T00:00:00+05:30\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Check for known offenders with similar MO returning to ward 170 in past 90 days\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_calls_near\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Identify emergency calls near the crime scene for witness leads\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_tip_corroboration\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Corroborate any tips received for this case\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_news\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Check media coverage for additional details or public appeals\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_context\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-000945\"\n      },\n      \"why\